  "guide": "Speak in a warm, direct brand voice. Lead with a bold heading and one sentence of context. Prefer a single primary action per screen; secondary actions are quiet buttons. Group related fields in a card and keep everything else flat. Use friendly, concrete labels with units. All state, props and actions follow the core catalog exactly; never use kit-specific component names in model output.",
